  "comment": "The KDS and ready-board rules as a scenario corpus (web-till spec v2 §6.8; work plan S0-11): client/src/lib/kdsBoard.ts (buttons, timer, what is on screen, the optimistic overlay, settling, refusals), kdsScreenEngine.ts (delivery of an action, backoff, limits) and pickupBoard.ts (the board's numbers). Checked against the TS in client/src/lib/kdsBoardGolden.test.ts; the APK passes the same bytes in P6-9 (PARITY.md §2.3 lists ~27 rules where it differs today — `parityNotes`). Both sides pin the LF-normalised SHA-256. Orders and tasks are written as overrides of `defaults.order` / `defaults.task` / `defaults.change`; an order's tasks get its `id` as `orderId`. Times are ISO; `now` is an ISO time. In `expect`, a `pending` key compares truthiness; every other key compares exactly.",
  "version": 1,
  "parityNotes": [
    "start required: Android shows 'הכול מוכן' and the cloud refuses (start_required); here 'התחל הכול' / 'התחל (n)' — orderButtons",
    "'נמסר' only when the order tracks handover — orderButtons",
    "handed-over (and bumped) orders leave the cards for the Expo's 'recent' strip with 'החזר' — screenOf, recallButton",
    "the timer counts from the oldest OPEN item's release (a later round restarts it), on the cloud's clock — orderTimer",
    "cancelled items stay on the card struck through; a station card whose items were all cancelled leaves once the cancellation was seen — screenOf",
    "cards are re-sorted: urgent first, then the oldest; on a station, cards with nothing left to do go last — sortOrders",
    "the outbox retries 5xx / 408 / 429 up to 6 times with backoff and drops 401 (Android: 401 and 5xx forever, drops 408 / 429) — deliveryOf, backoffMs",
    "expectedVersion only for an item action sent at once from a live board (version_conflict)",
    "a delivered action stays drawn until the board shows it, at most 15 s — isSettled",
    "undo_pickup turns handed over -> ready as well as ready -> waiting — applyPending",
    "the outbox is capped at 2000 waiting actions — constants.OUTBOX_MAX"
  ],
